ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>طراحی ریسپانسیو و مدرن</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>بهینه‌سازی برای سئو</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>سرعت بالا و امنیت</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>پشتیبانی و نگهداری</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full gradient-bg text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">درخواست مشاوره رایگان</button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-0 shadow-md animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 space-x-reverse\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-8 w-8 text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-asre-blue-600 transition-colors\">مشاوره استراتژیک</h3><div class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-asre-green-600 mt-1\">از ۲ میلیون تومان</div></div></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4\">مشاوره تخصصی برای تعیین بهترین استراتژی بازاریابی دیجیتال کسب‌وکار شما</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تحلیل وضعیت فعلی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تعیین اهداف و KPI ها</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>طراحی نقشه راه</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>پیگیری و ارزیابی</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full gradient-bg text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">درخواست مشاوره رایگان</button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground group hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border-0 shadow-md animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 space-x-reverse\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column-increasing h-8 w-8 text-white\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-asre-blue-600 transition-colors\">آنالیتیکس و گزارش‌گیری</h3><div class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-asre-green-600 mt-1\">از ۱.۵ میلیون تومان</div></div></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4\">تحلیل عمیق داده‌ها و ارائه گزارش‌های جامع برای بهبود عملکرد</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تنظیم گوگل آنالیتیکس</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>ردیابی تبدیل</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>گزارش‌های تفصیلی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>توصیه‌های بهبود</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full gradient-bg text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">درخواست مشاوره رایگان</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-background-50 to-background-100 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-5\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgb(var(--primary-500)) 1px, transparent 0);background-size:40px 40px\"></div></div><div class=\"container-custom relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-20 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-8\">چرا <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-secondary-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">عصر سئو</span> را انتخاب کنید؟</h2><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">مزایای همکاری با تیم حرفه‌ای و متخصص عصر سئو</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-400 to-accent-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-400 to-accent-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-10 w-10 text-white\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">تیم متخصص و با تجربه</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">متخصصان ما با سال‌ها تجربه در زمینه دیجیتال مارکتینگ آماده خدمت‌رسانی هستند</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-400 to-secondary-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-400 to-secondary-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-10 w-10 text-white\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">نتایج قابل اندازه‌گیری</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">تمام فعالیت‌های ما بر اساس داده و آمار بوده و نتایج قابل اندازه‌گیری ارائه می‌دهیم</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 to-primary-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 to-primary-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-10 w-10 text-white\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">روش‌های ایمن و مطمئن</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">تمام تکنیک‌های ما مطابق با استانداردهای گوگل و کاملاً ایمن هستند</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.30000000000000004s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-300 to-primary-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-300 to-primary-500 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-10 w-10 text-white\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">پشتیبانی ۲۴/۷</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">تیم پشتیبانی ما همیشه در دسترس شما قرار دارد تا بهترین خدمات را دریافت کنید</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-primary-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-primary-500 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-10 w-10 text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">مشتری‌محوری</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">نیازها و اهداف شما در اولویت قرار دارد و تمام تلاش‌مان برای رضایت شماست</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-200 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-2 animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.5s\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 to-secondary-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 to-secondary-500 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:animate-glow transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-headphones h-10 w-10 text-white\"><path d=\"M3 14h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-6 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors duration-300\">مشاوره رایگان</h3><p class=\"text-text-600 leading-relaxed text-lg\">قبل از شروع هر پروژه، مشاوره کاملی در اختیار شما قرار می‌دهیم</p><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border-2 border-transparent group-hover:border-primary-200 transition-colors duration-500\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">فرآیند <span class=\"gradient-text\">همکاری</span> ما</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">چگونه با عصر سئو همکاری کنید و به نتایج دلخواه برسید</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center group animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">۱</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">مشاوره و تحلیل</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">ابتدا وضعیت فعلی کسب‌وکار شما را تحلیل کرده و نیازهای شما را بررسی می‌کنیم</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-10 left-1/2 w-full h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-200 to-gray-300 transform translate-x-1/2\"></div></div><div class=\"text-center group animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">۲</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">طراحی استراتژی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">بر اساس تحلیل انجام شده، بهترین استراتژی را طراحی و ارائه می‌دهیم</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-10 left-1/2 w-full h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-200 to-gray-300 transform translate-x-1/2\"></div></div><div class=\"text-center group animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">۳</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">اجرا و پیاده‌سازی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">استراتژی طراحی شده را با دقت و حرفه‌ای‌ترین شکل پیاده‌سازی می‌کنیم</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-10 left-1/2 w-full h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-200 to-gray-300 transform translate-x-1/2\"></div></div><div class=\"text-center group animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-red-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">۴</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">نظارت و بهینه‌سازی</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">عملکرد را مداوم رصد کرده و بهینه‌سازی‌های لازم را انجام می‌دهیم</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">پکیج‌های <span class=\"gradient-text\">خدماتی</span> ما</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">بسته‌های متنوع و منطبق با نیاز کسب‌وکار شما</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground relative overflow-hidden border-gray-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">پایه</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6\">مناسب برای کسب‌وکارهای کوچک</p><div class=\"mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">۲.۵</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 mr-2\">میلیون تومان</span><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">ماهانه</div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>سئو پایه سایت</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تحلیل رقبا</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>گزارش ماهانه</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>پشتیبانی ایمیلی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>۱۰ کلمه کلیدی</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all\">انتخاب پلن پایه</button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground relative overflow-hidden border-asre-blue-500 border-2 shadow-xl scale-105 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 left-0\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-asre-blue-500 to-asre-green-500 text-white text-center py-2 text-sm font-medium\">محبوب‌ترین انتخاب</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pt-12\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">حرفه‌ای</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6\">محبوب‌ترین انتخاب کسب‌وکارها</p><div class=\"mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">۵</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 mr-2\">میلیون تومان</span><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">ماهانه</div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>سئو کامل و پیشرفته</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تبلیغات گوگل ادز</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>مدیریت شبکه‌های اجتماعی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>گزارش‌گیری هفتگی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>پشتیبانی تلفنی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>۳۰ کلمه کلیدی</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تولید محتوا</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full gradient-bg text-white transition-all\">انتخاب پلن حرفه‌ای</button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground relative overflow-hidden border-gray-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">پیشرفته</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6\">برای کسب‌وکارهای بزرگ</p><div class=\"mb-6\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">۱۰</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 mr-2\">میلیون تومان</span><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">ماهانه</div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>تمام خدمات پلن حرفه‌ای</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>مشاوره استراتژیک</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>طراحی لندینگ پیج</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>ایمیل مارکتینگ</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>A/B تست</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>آنالیز عمیق داده‌ها</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>کلمات کلیدی نامحدود</li><li class=\"flex items-center text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-asre-green-100 flex items-center justify-center ml-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-asre-green-500\"></div></div>مدیر اختصاصی پروژه</li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 px-4 py-2 w-full bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all\">انتخاب پلن پیشرفته</button></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-12\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">نیاز به پکیج سفارشی دارید؟</p><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border bg-background hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2 border-asre-blue-500 text-asre-blue-600 hover:bg-asre-blue-50\">درخواست پکیج سفارشی</button></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">نظرات <span class=\"gradient-text\">مشتریان</span> ما</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">تجربه مشتریان راضی از همکاری با عصر سئو</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border hover:shadow-md transition-shadow animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex items-center mb-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl ml-4\">👨‍💼</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">احمد محمدی</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">فروشگاه آنلاین رویا</p></div></div><blockquote class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed italic\">&quot;<!-- -->همکاری با عصر سئو نقطه عطفی در کسب‌وکار ما بود. ترافیک سایت ما ۴۰۰٪ افزایش یافت و فروش آنلاین‌مان به طور چشمگیری رشد کرد.<!-- -->&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"flex text-yellow-400 mt-4\"><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border hover:shadow-md transition-shadow animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex items-center mb-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl ml-4\">👩‍⚕️</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">فاطمه احمدی</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">کلینیک زیبایی نور</p></div></div><blockquote class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed italic\">&quot;<!-- -->تیم عصر سئو با حرفه‌ای‌ترین شیوه ممکن کلینیک ما را در گوگل به رتبه‌های اول رساند. اکنون مشتریان زیادی از طریق اینترنت پیدا می‌کنیم.<!-- -->&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"flex text-yellow-400 mt-4\"><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border hover:shadow-md transition-shadow animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"flex items-center mb-6\"><div class=\"text-4xl ml-4\">👷‍♂️</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900\">علی رضایی</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">شرکت ساختمانی پارس</p></div></div><blockquote class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed italic\">&quot;<!-- -->مشاوره‌های عصر سئو بسیار ارزشمند بود. آن‌ها به ما کمک کردند تا استراتژی درستی برای حضور آنلاین‌مان تعریف کنیم.<!-- -->&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"flex text-yellow-400 mt-4\"><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-asre-blue-600 to-asre-green-600\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border-white/20 text-white\"><div class=\"text-center p-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 animate-fade-in\">آماده شروع همکاری هستید؟</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-fade-in\">همین الان با ما تماس بگیرید و مشاوره رایگان دریافت کنید. تیم متخصص ما آماده پاسخگویی به سوالات شماست.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-8 w-8 mb-3\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.6